      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of loss and disconnect from your former self, which is an incredibly heavy thing to carry. Recognizing that the intense, competitive part of you has shifted is a significant part of this grieving process. Please know that this feeling of being a \"shell\" is often a reaction to a major life trauma, and it's okay to feel this quiet emptiness right now. Healing involves finding ways to honor that past self while gently welcoming who you are becoming now.",
      "source": "target",
